00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:33.000 align:start position:0%
 Science is our times lingua-franca and can form bridges between countries and cultures.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:39.000 align:start position:0%
 The importance of research is therefore not only limited to the generation of new knowledge,

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:48.000 align:start position:0%
